            <forecast-period index="2" start-time-local="2026-09-24T00:00:00+09:30" end-time-local="2026-09-25T00:00:00+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-09-23T14:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-09-24T14:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Cloudy. Medium chance of showers. Winds northeasterly 15 to 20 km/h tending northerly 15 to 25 km/h before dawn then becoming light in the late afternoon. Overnight temperatures falling to between 11 and 14 with daytime temperatures reaching the low to mid 20s.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="3" start-time-local="2026-09-25T00:00:00+09:30" end-time-local="2026-09-26T00:00:00+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-09-24T14:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-09-25T14:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Cloudy. Medium chance of showers, most likely in the morning. Light winds becoming southeasterly 15 to 25 km/h during the afternoon. Overnight temperatures falling to around 13 with daytime temperatures reaching around 20.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="4" start-time-local="2026-09-26T00:00:00+09:30" end-time-local="2026-09-27T00:00:00+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-09-25T14:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-09-26T14:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Cloudy. Slight chance of a shower, most likely in the morning. Winds southeasterly 20 to 30 km/h turning easterly during the day. Overnight temperatures falling to around 12 with daytime temperatures reaching around 20.</text>
